{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "对命主之描述？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n命主日主为庚金，生于寅月（孟春），木旺金囚。月柱甲寅，偏财当令，木气强盛。庚金坐子水伤官，时柱甲申，申为庚之禄根。年柱戊辰土印帮扶，整体日主有根有源，不算衰弱，但春月木旺耗金，身非极强。  \n- 庚金性质刚锐，得禄于申，骨架偏宽大，但子水伤官泄秀，兼木火（寅中藏丙）透甲，有修长之象。  \n- 木主延伸，水主流动，甲木偏财贴身，骨肉匀停，不易聚集脂肪。  \n- 综合五行流通与十神特性，日主非娇小、非健壮、非微胖，更偏向瘦长有骨感之态。  \n\n### 最终答案  \nD", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q35", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 8617, "response_id": "22c4f330-023c-4d96-b46a-a85e295595aa", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 212, "completion_tokens": 450, "total_tokens": 662, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 244}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 84}}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q36", "domain": "study", "question": "命主学历状况为何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "**推理分析**\n\n1. **日主状态**：日主癸水生于未月，燥土当令，地支未、戌成势，时干己土七杀透出，全局火土极旺。癸水在地支无根，仅月干癸水比肩遥扶，年干庚金正印远隔被燥土脆金，生助之力微弱。日主极弱，有从弱势之象，若按身弱论亦食神制杀、印星为用。\n\n2. **学历核心十神**：以印星（庚金）与食伤（卯木）为学历参考。年干庚金正印为用神，但坐戌土受丁火克、燥土脆，根气受伤，先天印星状态不佳；日支卯木食神可为智慧星，但卯未半合木又逢未土燥，食神受制，慧性有损。\n\n3. **大运走向**：男命庚戌年顺排，约5岁8个月起运。第一步甲申运（约1975-1985），甲木伤官透出制杀，申金为正印旺地，伤官配印，利于学业起步；第二步乙酉运（约1985-1995），酉金偏印得地，乙木食神合印，求学阶段有金运扶持，能取得一定学历。但原局印星受伤，大运虽补却难圆满，且在乙酉运末入丙戌燥土忌神运，不利更高深造。\n\n4. **综合推断**：命主幼年及青年时期大运见印，能完成基础教育甚至专科层次。原局印星根基薄弱，高学历（博士）需印星强旺，此造难以达到；文盲、小学肄业又与大运印星补救相悖。故学历以中等偏上但未达顶级为合理，即高中或专科肄业水平。\n\n**最终答案：C**", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q36", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 47407, "response_id": "b9c42ad9-1662-4a7c-aa09-4223ca582dd3", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 213, "completion_tokens": 2677, "total_tokens": 2890, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2249}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 85}}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q37", "domain": "career", "question": "命主出社会后的工作？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "八字庚戌 癸未 癸卯 己未，日主癸水生于未月，土旺用事，官杀强盛。天干透庚金正印，癸水比肩，己土七杀；地支卯未半合木局，未戌相刑。日主身弱，喜金水帮扶，以年干庚金正印化杀生身为关键用神。杀印相生，主文化、学识、稳定之职，且印星为庚金，有正规教育、技术或体制内象。原局缺财，官杀虽旺但无财生，非商贾之命。时柱己未七杀有庚金化解，可为管理之权，但全局偏重文教事业。结合神煞与五行，庚金正印高透，多为教师、公务员等岗位。故推命主出社会后工作应以学校任教为最大可能。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q37", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 29555, "response_id": "fc928c58-8a9c-44d4-8603-46e854dcace7", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 225, "completion_tokens": 1475, "total_tokens": 1700, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1273}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 97}}
